{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49686","headline":"浣溪沙 · 阎选","name":"浣溪沙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寞流苏冷绣茵，倚屏山枕惹香尘，小庭花露泣浓春。\n刘阮信非仙洞客，嫦娥终是月中人，此生无路访东邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"阎选","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49686.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49686","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}